#: usr/share/fish-tweak-tool/ftt_gui.py:114
msgid ""
"<b>Starship</b> — a fast, highly-customisable cross-shell prompt (a single "
"Rust binary, not a fisher plugin). Applying installs the <tt>starship</tt> "
"package if needed and enables it via <tt>starship init fish</tt>.\n"
"\n"
"<b>First steps:</b> configure it in <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt>; browse "
"presets and modules:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Starship</b>：快速且高度可定制的跨 shell 提示符（单个 Rust 二进制文件，不"
"是 fisher 插件）。应用时会在需要时安装 <tt>starship</tt> 软件包，并通过 <tt>"
"starship init fish</tt> 启用。\n"
"\n"
"<b>入门步骤：</b>在 <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt> 中进行配置；浏览预设和模"
"块："

